cff-version: 1.2.0
title: 'Simulations using npsim and Geant4 (ePIC tutorial)'
message: >-
  Please cite this lesson using the information in this file
  when you refer to it in publications, and/or if you
  re-use, adapt, or expand on the content in your own
  training material.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Wouter
    family-names: Deconinck
  - name: The ePIC Collaboration
abstract: >-
  An ePIC tutorial on running detector simulations with ddsim and npsim, covering
  single-particle simulations with the DD4hep particle gun and full physics-event
  simulations from HepMC3/Pythia8 input. Built with The Carpentries Workbench.
keywords:
  - EIC
  - ePIC
  - ddsim
  - npsim
  - Geant4
  - DD4hep
  - simulation
  - EDM4hep
repository-code: 'https://github.com/eic/tutorial-simulations-using-npsim-and-geant4'
